    {
      "SourceElementId": "G11-U06-L01-ACTIVITY-012",
      "SourceSection": "1.3: Where is the Point?",
      "SourceExcerpt": "A circle centered at \\((0,0)\\) has a radius of 10. Point \\(S\\) on the circle has an \\(x\\)-coordinate of 6. What is the \\(y\\)-coordinate of point \\(S\\)? Explain or show your reasoning.",
